function stats(){return `<div class="cards">${[['今日待办',pending(),'项','完成后自动更新','task'],['待服务客户',4,'位','咨询 · 回访 · 补货','users'],['本月关联成交','28,640','元','演示基线，非真实业绩','chart'],['90天复购率','32.8','%','演示基线，非实测结果','leaf']].map(([l,v,u,d,i])=>`<div class="stat"><div class="between"><span class="stat-label">${l}</span><span class="stat-icon">${icon(i)}</span></div><div class="stat-number">${v}<small>${u}</small></div><div class="delta">${d}</div></div>`).join('')}</div>`}
function taskRows(tasks){return tasks.length?tasks.map(t=>{const c=customer(t.cid);return `<div class="task-row"><button class="check ${t.done?'done':''}" data-complete="${t.id}" aria-label="${t.done?'查看完成结果':'完成任务'}">${t.done?icon('check'):''}</button><div class="task-body"><div class="task-top"><h3>${esc(t.title)}</h3><span class="tag ${t.done?'gray':t.priority==='优先处理'?'orange':''}">${t.done?'已完成':t.priority}</span></div><div class="task-desc">${esc(t.desc)}</div><div class="task-foot"><span>${esc(c.name)}</span><span>·</span><span>${t.type}</span><span>·</span><span>${esc(t.time)}</span></div>${t.result?`<p class="task-desc" style="margin-top:7px;color:#60916f">处理结果：${esc(t.result)}</p>`:''}</div><button class="btn tiny ${t.priority==='优先处理'&&!t.done?'primary':''}" data-open="${c.id}">${t.done?'查看客户':'去跟进'} ${icon('arrow')}</button></div>`}).join(''):'<div class="empty">当前没有这类任务，所有服务都井井有条。</div>'}
